## 3. My recommended 6-month reading and learning plan

# Wix developer development plan

1. Month 1 – Become a better designer
   - Refactoring UI
   - The Non-Designer's Design Book
   Project: Design a professional website for a fictional local business from a blank Wix Studio canvas.
2. Month 2 – Master Wix Studio
   - Learning Web Design
