   Project: Recreate a professional website design with desktop, tablet and mobile layouts.
3. Month 3 – Learn JavaScript and CSS
   - Eloquent JavaScript
   - CSS in Depth
   Project: Build custom interactions, animations and responsive components.
4. Month 4 – Become a Wix developer
   - The Pragmatic Programmer
   - Wix Velo and JavaScript SDK documentation
   Project: Build a dynamic website using CMS, custom forms and API integrations.
5. Month 5 – Understand users and search engines
   - Don't Make Me Think
   - The Art of SEO
   Project: Optimize a website for accessibility, usability, SEO and performance.
6. Month 6 – Think like a professional developer
   - A Philosophy of Software Design
   - Inclusive Design Patterns
